For our location in Ghimbav (Romania) we are currently looking for a
 Financial Controller
 Your Responsibilities
Prepare annual budgets, periodic forecasts, and financial plans in line with Group requirements;
Monitor and control operating expenses, analyze budget variances, and provide financial insights to management;
Perform cost center controlling and support investment (CAPEX) controlling activities;
Ensure the accuracy, consistency, and reliability of financial data across ERP and reporting systems;
Develop, improve, and automate controlling reports, dashboards, and analytical tools;
Analyze financial and operational performance and prepare management reports and presentations;
Support month-end and year-end closing activities, including accruals, provisions, and financial analyses;
Monitor key financial and operational KPIs and recommend actions to improve business performance;
Act as a business partner to department managers, supporting decision-making and cost optimization initiatives;
Assist with internal and external audits and ensure compliance with Group policies and internal controls.
 YOUR PROFILE
University degree in Accounting or Business Administration;
3-5 years of experience in a Controlling, Financial Analyst, or Financial Controller role, preferably within a multinational or manufacturing environment;
Good understanding of financial reporting principles and IFRS;
SAP or an ERP system, would be considered an advantage;
Very good Microsoft Excel skills;
Excellent communication, organization, and problem-solving skills;
Structured and analytical with a thorough mindset;
Ability to work both independently and in multidisciplinary teams;
Fluent in written and spoken English.
 WHY PREH?
